meta {
  name: Auth
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  Sign-up, sign-in (password, two-factor, Google/GitHub), sessions and
  password management, plus the public `App Config` and the Reverb
  `Broadcasting Auth` endpoint.

  Sign-in requests store `accessToken`. The refresh token is never in a
  response body: it travels as an httpOnly `refresh_token` cookie that
  `Refresh Token` reads, so keep Bruno's cookie jar enabled.
}
